Subject: [PATCH 1532/3799] soh: rename func_80ABD3B8 -> EnNy_UpdateBuoyancy

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: turns gravity off and eases the vertical velocity toward the swim target while the actor is between the two given water depths, and restores normal gravity otherwise.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ny/z_en_ny.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ny/z_en_ny.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ny/z_en_ny.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ny/z_en_ny.c
index ab490bc53..a157e3b29 100644
